sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Parent as Parent AgentSessionRuntime
    participant Bridge as IceAgentViewBridge
    participant Shell as InteractiveMode shell
    participant Child as Live child AgentSession
    participant Runner as NativeSubagentRunner

    User->>Parent: /agents
    User->>Bridge: select live child
    Bridge->>Shell: requestDisplay(child runId)
    Note over Parent,Shell: Parent runtime remains authoritative
    Shell->>Child: bind display, footer, transcript, events
    Child-->>Shell: thinking, messages, tool events
    User->>Bridge: Take Control
    Bridge->>Child: setControlled(true)
    User->>Shell: steering message
    Shell->>Bridge: sendInput(child, text)
    Bridge->>Child: AgentSession.prompt(... steer when streaming)
    User->>Bridge: release control / return parent
    Bridge->>Child: setControlled(false)
    Runner->>Child: explicit final bounded report request
    Child-->>Runner: strict final JSON
    Runner->>Runner: parse, cap, evidence verification
    Runner-->>Parent: bounded verified result only
    Runner->>Bridge: bounded redacted historical snapshot
    Bridge->>Shell: LIVE becomes HISTORY
